        "original_id": "983a56a8-5495-58a2-b67c-f5570cf9a773",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Kid Rock, Sheryl Crow, Allison Moorer\n- Products: Cocky, \"Picture\", \"Lonely Road of Faith\"\n- Companies: Atlantic, Crow's label\n- Topics: duets, radio re-recordings, single releases\n\nFacts:\n- Kid Rock's 2001 album \"Cocky\" includes the ballad \"Picture\" as a duet with Sheryl Crow.\n- Atlantic was initially unable to get release rights from Sheryl Crow's label for the album version of \"Picture\" to be issued as a single.\n- Kid Rock re-recorded \"Picture\" for radio with Allison Moorer as an alternative version.\n- \"Lonely Road of Faith\" was the second single released from Kid Rock's 2001 album \"Cocky\".",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
